# Ob Nixilis, the Adversary +1 in a three-player game: "Each opponent loses 2 life unless they discard a card." Each opponent
# chooses in turn order from Bot1 (CR 101.4) - Bot2 first, declining, then Bot3, discarding a Mountain - and only then are the
# discard and the life loss done: Bot2 is at 18 with its hand whole, Bot3 at 20 with a card in its graveyard. That the losses
# are one event is the Rust test each_opponent_loses_life_unless_together.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Ob Nixilis, the Adversary
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x14

[Bot3 Deck]
Mountain x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ob Nixilis, the Adversary.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Cast without casualty)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Ob Nixilis, the Adversary.Activate(Ability: +1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass
Bot2.Decline
Bot3.Accept
Bot3.Choose(Mountain)
[T2 Bot2.Upkeep]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot3.Life = 20
Bot3.Hand.Count = 6
Bot3.Graveyard.Count = 1
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Ob Nixilis, the Adversary.Counters.Loyalty = 4
